  "spiritual_reading": "# Spiritual Translation\n\n** ¶2:** When the Divine Human first descended into combat against the hells, He clothed Himself in the outer most expression of divine love. With that love He collapsed the swelling pride of evil; He laid bare its persu asive falsities and reduced its empty self -exaltation to nothing.\n\n**¶3:** Now , divine love alone would have been sufficient against them . Yet because love in its outermost form was weakened when it entered directly into the assault of the hells, the Divine provided four additional degrees of truth to support it: the truth of spiritual thought, the truth of natural understanding , the truth of intellectual clarity, and the truth of in most rational life. And why were these four given? They were given so that they would serve and protect divine love on every side — so that fals ity would not penetrate through love and corrupt it, and so that the poison and enmity of evil would not s ever love from its source .\n\n**¶4:** Divine love in its outermost expression received the full assault and was wounded. Yet still , all the powers of hell were held at bay because of it. Of necessity , the tru ths at every level — love 's companion fac ulties — also received the wound of that assault . Fals ity from evil became min gled with them. All except the inmost rational life . Evil could not m ingle with it , nor could the consuming fire of self -love penetrate it.\n\n** ¶5:** Nevertheless , even that faculty which remained behind without wound — the inmost rational life — div ested itself of its own protective truth and communicated its power to its four wounded companions , so that by the truth of that unw ounded rational life they would be strengthened, and sustained , and end ure: namely , love and its three fellow tru ths. And it became for them the hidden well spring of life itself .",
